Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.76,0:00:39.06,Default,,0,0,0,,喂，老公？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.30,0:00:44.50,Default,,0,0,0,,这周末也不回来吗
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.64,0:00:48.00,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.00,0:00:50.32,Default,,0,0,0,,工作加油
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.70,0:00:57.00,Default,,0,0,0,,两年前，丈夫被派去了外地
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.64,0:01:00.64,Default,,0,0,0,,一开始每个周末都会回家
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.64,0:01:04.76,Default,,0,0,0,,但渐渐地，回来的次数越来越少
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.70,0:01:10.22,Default,,0,0,0,,他八成在外面有人了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.22,0:01:15.72,Default,,0,0,0,,可没有证据，我也开不了口
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.50,0:01:19.83,Default,,0,0,0,,就这样，为了排遣寂寞
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.83,0:01:22.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我做了一份特别的工作
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.30,0:01:24.94,Default,,0,0,0,,早上好
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.94,0:01:26.69,Default,,0,0,0,,早
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.69,0:01:30.49,Default,,0,0,0,,小枫，最近怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.49,0:01:33.11,Default,,0,0,0,,工作习惯了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.11,0:01:38.14,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯…不过还没有指名客
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.64,0:01:42.30,Default,,0,0,0,,新人嘛，服务得再卖力点
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.45,0:01:43.16,Default,,0,0,0,,得拿下指名才行
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.16,0:01:44.73,Default,,0,0,0,,好好加油吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.73,0:01:46.24,Default,,0,0,0,,加油
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.10,0:01:48.50,Default,,0,0,0,,好，谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.50,0:01:53.77,Default,,0,0,0,,美希姐，你的指名客来了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.78,0:01:59.40,Default,,0,0,0,,小枫，你刚到不好意思
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.40,0:02:01.69,Default,,0,0,0,,帮忙接个散客行吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.69,0:02:04.30,Default,,0,0,0,,好，换好衣服就过去
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.24,0:02:07.74,Default,,0,0,0,,哎呀，客人来得真早
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.74,0:02:09.44,Default,,0,0,0,,别在意啦
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.56,0:02:16.60,Default,,0,0,0,,"枫"是我在店里的花名
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.38,0:02:21.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我现在是一名泡泡浴女郎
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.34,0:02:49.70,Default,,0,0,0,,初次见面，我叫小枫
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.70,0:02:51.74,Default,,0,0,0,,请多关照
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.90,0:02:55.78,Default,,0,0,0,,请多关照
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.60,0:02:59.54,Default,,0,0,0,,你很紧张吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.74,0:03:05.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我也是第一次来这种地方
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.74,0:03:08.02,Default,,0,0,0,,是嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.42,0:03:15.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我也还是新人，不过交给我就好，会让你放松的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.40,0:03:22.52,Default,,0,0,0,,喜欢接吻吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.32,0:03:28.22,Default,,0,0,0,,最喜欢了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.72,0:03:49.48,Default,,0,0,0,,好可爱
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.02,0:03:53.53,Default,,0,0,0,,好好亲热一下吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.40,0:03:56.88,Default,,0,0,0,,你叫什么名字
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.88,0:03:57.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我是小枫
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.60,0:04:00.18,Default,,0,0,0,,不是，我问你的名字
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.58,0:04:02.12,Default,,0,0,0,,你呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.12,0:04:04.20,Default,,0,0,0,,悠太
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.20,0:04:08.18,Default,,0,0,0,,那我叫你悠太咯
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.56,0:05:33.90,Default,,0,0,0,,亲得好舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.04,0:05:55.06,Default,,0,0,0,,帮你脱哦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.18,0:06:28.18,Default,,0,0,0,,衣服脱了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.20,0:08:14.38,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯…舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.38,0:09:32.50,Default,,0,0,0,,让我摸摸
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.80,0:09:38.62,Default,,0,0,0,,已经这么硬了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.96,0:09:48.82,Default,,0,0,0,,那我开动咯
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.36,0:10:28.12,Default,,0,0,0,,让我看看
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.00,0:10:32.70,Default,,0,0,0,,舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.72,0:10:35.46,Default,,0,0,0,,这么硬啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.58,0:10:40.34,Default,,0,0,0,,不好意思，有点…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.34,0:10:52.40,Default,,0,0,0,,看你硬成这样，好开心
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.10,0:11:01.56,Default,,0,0,0,,还在跳呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.84,0:11:18.09,Default,,0,0,0,,舒服吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.54,0:11:20.72,Default,,0,0,0,,很硬吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.72,0:11:25.86,Default,,0,0,0,,不好意思，快射了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.02,0:11:31.35,Default,,0,0,0,,转过来这边
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.70,0:12:05.30,Default,,0,0,0,,等等，还没洗呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.30,0:12:09.75,Default,,0,0,0,,没关系，我帮你舔干净
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.32,0:12:19.00,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.62,0:12:44.20,Default,,0,0,0,,舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.98,0:13:30.58,Default,,0,0,0,,继续咯
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.64,0:14:22.93,Default,,0,0,0,,等等，那里脏的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.93,0:14:25.56,Default,,0,0,0,,才不脏
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.46,0:14:35.28,Default,,0,0,0,,糟了，等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.02,0:14:55.20,Default,,0,0,0,,让你好好爽一下
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.38,0:15:25.66,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下，不行了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.66,0:15:29.00,Default,,0,0,0,,停一下
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.00,0:15:32.92,Default,,0,0,0,,快射了，还不能
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.92,0:15:34.01,Default,,0,0,0,,还不能吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.01,0:15:36.70,Default,,0,0,0,,真是坏孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.70,0:15:40.08,Default,,0,0,0,,就要这样好好吊着你
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.82,0:15:43.08,Default,,0,0,0,,糟了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.32,0:15:57.67,Default,,0,0,0,,要去了？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.18,0:16:18.07,Default,,0,0,0,,太要命了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.42,0:16:20.54,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.74,0:16:25.28,Default,,0,0,0,,要射了…\N要射了？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.32,0:16:29.56,Default,,0,0,0,,那我看着你射
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.68,0:16:48.04,Default,,0,0,0,,射了好多
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.06,0:16:53.48,Default,,0,0,0,,有点…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.20,0:17:06.04,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起，没忍住
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.62,0:17:11.30,Default,,0,0,0,,时间还早呢，射几次都行
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.92,0:17:16.50,Default,,0,0,0,,而且你看起来还能来好多次
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.28,0:17:23.16,Default,,0,0,0,,去洗澡吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.34,0:17:30.89,Default,,0,0,0,,帮我脱
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.89,0:17:35.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我来帮你脱
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.90,0:18:21.69,Default,,0,0,0,,水烫吗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.69,0:18:24.09,Default,,0,0,0,,刚好
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.09,0:18:25.80,Default,,0,0,0,,那我开始洗咯
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.00,0:19:05.96,Default,,0,0,0,,洗咯
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.04,0:20:01.60,Default,,0,0,0,,悠太做什么工作的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.58,0:20:06.88,Default,,0,0,0,,在食品公司做销售
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.66,0:20:10.80,Default,,0,0,0,,销售很辛苦吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.92,0:20:15.91,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊，业绩全看数字
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.91,0:20:18.52,Default,,0,0,0,,压力挺大的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.64,0:20:25.14,Default,,0,0,0,,那今天就让我好好犒劳你
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.29,0:21:31.63,Default,,0,0,0,,越来越舒服了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.78,0:22:29.99,Default,,0,0,0,,洗洗背
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.18,0:24:03.60,Default,,0,0,0,,冲干净了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.21,0:24:55.58,Default,,0,0,0,,舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.26,0:25:27.30,Default,,0,0,0,,好舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.74,0:25:45.82,Default,,0,0,0,,你这么舒服我就开心了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.82,0:25:50.74,Default,,0,0,0,,真的超舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.06,0:26:38.69,Default,,0,0,0,,用热水帮你暖暖
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.46,0:28:58.46,Default,,0,0,0,,好厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.48,0:29:05.72,Default,,0,0,0,,舒服死了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.02,0:30:14.08,Default,,0,0,0,,等等，又快了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.08,0:30:16.09,Default,,0,0,0,,还不行哦
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.09,0:30:19.80,Default,,0,0,0,,先帮你冲一下
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.00,0:30:34.50,Default,,0,0,0,,烫吗
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.06,0:31:06.82,Default,,0,0,0,,先漱个口
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.40,0:31:25.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我去准备气垫床
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.58,0:33:15.72,Default,,0,0,0,,好舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.41,0:35:25.64,Default,,0,0,0,,舒服死了
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.94,0:36:43.76,Default,,0,0,0,,不行了
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.70,0:36:46.84,Default,,0,0,0,,快去了
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.16,0:36:57.77,Default,,0,0,0,,对了，你还没试过气垫床吧
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.23,0:37:00.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我去准备一下
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.60,0:38:22.54,Default,,0,0,0,,趴上来
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.64,0:38:37.28,Default,,0,0,0,,这样？
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.10,0:38:50.96,Default,,0,0,0,,倒润滑液了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.88,0:40:01.13,Default,,0,0,0,,舒服死了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.13,0:40:07.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我会用全身让你爽翻的
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.68,0:41:11.08,Default,,0,0,0,,好舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.16,0:41:42.54,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉到了吗，蹭到你了
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.78,0:41:45.68,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯…舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.38,0:44:12.64,Default,,0,0,0,,舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.66,0:46:05.16,Default,,0,0,0,,爽死了
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.94,0:46:33.18,Default,,0,0,0,,喘得好厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.50,0:47:36.82,Default,,0,0,0,,别…
Dialogue: 0,0:49:26.86,0:49:28.98,Default,,0,0,0,,舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:49:28.98,0:49:32.56,Default,,0,0,0,,太爽了
Dialogue: 0,0:50:00.36,0:50:02.92,Default,,0,0,0,,爽翻了
Dialogue: 0,0:51:28.34,0:51:29.76,Default,,0,0,0,,太厉害了
Dialogue: 0,0:51:32.08,0:51:34.47,Default,,0,0,0,,气垫床爽吧
Dialogue: 0,0:51:34.47,0:51:36.50,Default,,0,0,0,,爽得不行
Dialogue: 0,0:51:55.78,0:51:58.92,Default,,0,0,0,,真的太爽了
Dialogue: 0,0:52:26.74,0:52:29.68,Default,,0,0,0,,好舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:53:08.74,0:53:14.34,Default,,0,0,0,,爽死了
Dialogue: 0,0:53:19.86,0:53:23.68,Default,,0,0,0,,真的受不了
Dialogue: 0,0:53:48.60,0:53:50.12,Default,,0,0,0,,射外面了
Dialogue: 0,0:54:03.36,0:54:05.36,Default,,0,0,0,,戴套咯
Dialogue: 0,0:54:05.36,0:54:07.76,Default,,0,0,0,,看起来好舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:54:20.96,0:54:23.72,Default,,0,0,0,,爽死了
Dialogue: 0,0:55:18.18,0:55:20.18,Default,,0,0,0,,舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:55:56.08,0:55:58.28,Default,,0,0,0,,太舒服了
Dialogue: 0,0:56:16.10,0:56:18.30,Default,,0,0,0,,爽得不行
Dialogue: 0,0:56:18.30,0:56:21.06,Default,,0,0,0,,又射了
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.24,0:56:52.84,Default,,0,0,0,,真的太爽了
Dialogue: 0,0:57:39.26,0:57:41.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我还能再来吗
Dialogue: 0,0:57:41.78,0:57:42.62,Default,,0,0,0,,当然
Dialogue: 0,0:57:42.62,0:57:46.52,Default,,0,0,0,,交换联系方式吧
Dialogue: 0,0:57:48.10,0:57:49.72,Default,,0,0,0,,可以吗
Dialogue: 0,0:57:52.14,0:57:57.64,Default,,0,0,0,,以后想约直接联系我就行
Dialogue: 0,0:58:04.30,0:58:06.70,Default,,0,0,0,,来，扫一下
Dialogue: 0,0:58:07.16,0:58:08.56,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:58:15.41,0:58:16.76,Default,,0,0,0,,辛苦了
Dialogue: 0,0:58:23.10,0:58:26.77,Default,,0,0,0,,小枫，看你挺高兴嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:58:26.77,0:58:28.44,Default,,0,0,0,,遇到好客人了？
Dialogue: 0,0:58:30.86,0:58:32.42,Default,,0,0,0,,真好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:58:32.92,0:58:35.84,Default,,0,0,0,,好客人得好好把握住
Dialogue: 0,0:58:36.76,0:58:38.12,Default,,0,0,0,,就是
Dialogue: 0,0:58:38.60,0:58:46.92,Default,,0,0,0,,说到好客人，前阵子木村先生还给我搞了那个呢
Dialogue: 0,0:58:52.02,0:58:53.56,Default,,0,0,0,,好累
Dialogue: 0,0:59:06.54,0:59:12.19,Default,,0,0,0,,工作太忙，这阵子周末回不去了
Dialogue: 0,0:59:23.92,0:59:25.18,Default,,0,0,0,,搞什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:59:37.50,0:59:39.54,Default,,0,0,0,,今天真的谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:59:39.54,0:59:43.44,Default,,0,0,0,,能遇到小枫真的很开心
Dialogue: 0,0:59:43.44,0:59:44.70,Default,,0,0,0,,悠太
Dialogue: 0,1:00:01.40,1:00:07.30,Default,,0,0,0,,从那以后，悠太每个月都来找我
Dialogue: 0,1:00:08.98,1:00:13.36,Default,,0,0,0,,每一次，我们的身体都更加契合
Dialogue: 0,1:00:14.30,1:00:18.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我越来越渴望他
Dialogue: 0,1:00:18.80,1:00:20.54,Default,,0,0,0,,直到有一天——
Dialogue: 0,1:00:24.20,1:00:27.02,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你今天也来
Dialogue: 0,1:00:31.70,1:00:33.33,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,1:00:33.33,1:00:35.16,Default,,0,0,0,,一脸不高兴
Dialogue: 0,1:00:37.06,1:00:40.80,Default,,0,0,0,,今天有件事想跟你说
Dialogue: 0,1:00:44.96,1:00:50.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我要被调去北海道了
Dialogue: 0,1:00:52.40,1:00:57.90,Default,,0,0,0,,以后大概没法来找你了
Dialogue: 0,1:00:58.88,1:01:00.70,Default,,0,0,0,,这样啊…
Dialogue: 0,1:01:05.42,1:01:09.46,Default,,0,0,0,,那就把今天当作最后一次吧
Dialogue: 0,1:01:49.02,1:01:49.83,Default,,0,0,0,,那我开动了
Dialogue: 0,1:07:13.24,1:07:15.16,Default,,0,0,0,,手放下来
Dialogue: 0,1:07:47.04,1:07:49.64,Default,,0,0,0,,心情好点了吗
Dialogue: 0,1:07:50.46,1:07:52.52,Default,,0,0,0,,喜欢吗
Dialogue: 0,1:08:27.94,1:08:30.22,Default,,0,0,0,,好爽
Dialogue: 0,1:11:30.96,1:11:35.04,Default,,0,0,0,,用胸部夹哦
Dialogue: 0,1:13:01.26,1:13:05.02,Default,,0,0,0,,夹着好舒服
Dialogue: 0,1:13:05.02,1:13:07.54,Default,,0,0,0,,很舒服吧
Dialogue: 0,1:13:07.54,1:13:10.98,Default,,0,0,0,,尽情享受
Dialogue: 0,1:14:03.56,1:14:06.22,Default,,0,0,0,,舒服极了
Dialogue: 0,1:14:19.24,1:14:24.74,Default,,0,0,0,,好软
Dialogue: 0,1:15:42.04,1:15:43.86,Default,,0,0,0,,还不行哦
Dialogue: 0,1:15:44.86,1:15:48.04,Default,,0,0,0,,这里硬邦邦了呢
Dialogue: 0,1:15:48.04,1:15:54.04,Default,,0,0,0,,真可爱…啊不行
Dialogue: 0,1:15:54.04,1:15:56.97,Default,,0,0,0,,要射了
Dialogue: 0,1:16:33.84,1:16:37.20,Default,,0,0,0,,好好感受我的胸
Dialogue: 0,1:17:00.74,1:17:05.30,Default,,0,0,0,,快射了…嗯！
Dialogue: 0,1:17:14.18,1:17:16.94,Default,,0,0,0,,不行了
Dialogue: 0,1:17:17.70,1:17:21.00,Default,,0,0,0,,真可爱，一直忍着
Dialogue: 0,1:17:21.00,1:17:24.08,Default,,0,0,0,,再忍忍，后面会更爽
Dialogue: 0,1:17:24.88,1:17:27.65,Default,,0,0,0,,那为了让你更舒服
Dialogue: 0,1:17:27.65,1:17:30.12,Default,,0,0,0,,趴下，跪好
Dialogue: 0,1:17:30.15,1:17:31.10,Default,,0,0,0,,跪好？
Dialogue: 0,1:17:31.10,1:17:34.78,Default,,0,0,0,,从后面来
Dialogue: 0,1:18:46.97,1:18:49.78,Default,,0,0,0,,饶了我吧
Dialogue: 0,1:18:52.62,1:18:57.20,Default,,0,0,0,,真可爱
Dialogue: 0,1:19:19.10,1:19:21.86,Default,,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,1:19:27.22,1:19:29.56,Default,,0,0,0,,真不行了
Dialogue: 0,1:19:34.88,1:19:37.30,Default,,0,0,0,,忍住
Dialogue: 0,1:19:37.30,1:19:40.97,Default,,0,0,0,,忍得越久，最后越爽
Dialogue: 0,1:19:40.97,1:19:43.70,Default,,0,0,0,,真忍不住了
Dialogue: 0,1:19:59.10,1:20:06.54,Default,,0,0,0,,真的忍不住了
Dialogue: 0,1:20:11.72,1:20:16.66,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么办
Dialogue: 0,1:20:28.60,1:20:33.70,Default,,0,0,0,,没事，再忍一下
Dialogue: 0,1:20:51.18,1:20:53.00,Default,,0,0,0,,求你了
Dialogue: 0,1:20:55.66,1:20:58.60,Default,,0,0,0,,想插进去
Dialogue: 0,1:20:59.78,1:21:02.70,Default,,0,0,0,,躺好
Dialogue: 0,1:21:31.89,1:21:34.02,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,1:21:34.02,1:21:35.48,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,1:21:36.52,1:21:39.48,Default,,0,0,0,,慢慢进来
Dialogue: 0,1:22:23.55,1:22:26.18,Default,,0,0,0,,好紧
Dialogue: 0,1:22:27.84,1:22:30.12,Default,,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,1:22:36.92,1:22:42.77,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下，不行了
Dialogue: 0,1:22:42.77,1:22:46.44,Default,,0,0,0,,磨得受不了，糟了
Dialogue: 0,1:22:48.40,1:22:50.19,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,1:23:07.94,1:23:12.20,Default,,0,0,0,,不行不行
Dialogue: 0,1:23:22.96,1:23:28.14,Default,,0,0,0,,也要让小枫爽
Dialogue: 0,1:23:28.76,1:23:30.64,Default,,0,0,0,,让我也舒服舒服
Dialogue: 0,1:23:30.64,1:23:33.20,Default,,0,0,0,,让你好好爽
Dialogue: 0,1:24:23.34,1:24:25.47,Default,,0,0,0,,舒服吗
Dialogue: 0,1:24:25.47,1:24:29.82,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯…多摸摸我
Dialogue: 0,1:24:29.82,1:24:32.00,Default,,0,0,0,,喜欢
Dialogue: 0,1:27:00.80,1:27:02.60,Default,,0,0,0,,舒服吗
Dialogue: 0,1:28:04.08,1:28:06.72,Default,,0,0,0,,慢慢来
Dialogue: 0,1:28:26.00,1:28:30.26,Default,,0,0,0,,就这样，保持这样
Dialogue: 0,1:28:50.34,1:28:53.31,Default,,0,0,0,,好舒服
Dialogue: 0,1:28:54.70,1:28:56.72,Default,,0,0,0,,里面好舒服
Dialogue: 0,1:29:32.20,1:29:36.02,Default,,0,0,0,,舒服
Dialogue: 0,1:29:56.97,1:29:59.86,Default,,0,0,0,,要去了
Dialogue: 0,1:31:48.06,1:31:51.04,Default,,0,0,0,,去了！
Dialogue: 0,1:32:45.60,1:32:50.28,Default,,0,0,0,,受不了了
Dialogue: 0,1:32:51.90,1:32:54.14,Default,,0,0,0,,快动
Dialogue: 0,1:33:30.46,1:33:32.84,Default,,0,0,0,,去了
Dialogue: 0,1:33:37.78,1:33:40.68,Default,,0,0,0,,要去了要去了
Dialogue: 0,1:33:49.52,1:33:53.68,Default,,0,0,0,,快射给我
Dialogue: 0,1:33:58.28,1:34:00.56,Default,,0,0,0,,舒服
Dialogue: 0,1:35:31.36,1:35:39.28,Default,,0,0,0,,好热…里面好热
Dialogue: 0,1:35:49.68,1:35:58.70,Default,,0,0,0,,好舒服…悠太，随你怎么弄
Dialogue: 0,1:35:58.70,1:36:02.48,Default,,0,0,0,,真的？真的可以？
Dialogue: 0,1:36:03.80,1:36:07.18,Default,,0,0,0,,想从后面进去
Dialogue: 0,1:36:40.26,1:36:42.92,Default,,0,0,0,,舒服
Dialogue: 0,1:36:47.96,1:36:52.94,Default,,0,0,0,,就这样，顶到底
Dialogue: 0,1:36:53.82,1:36:57.88,Default,,0,0,0,,好舒服
Dialogue: 0,1:37:02.18,1:37:05.88,Default,,0,0,0,,那里…好舒服
Dialogue: 0,1:37:12.00,1:37:16.36,Default,,0,0,0,,就那里，最深处
Dialogue: 0,1:38:25.12,1:38:27.66,Default,,0,0,0,,不行
Dialogue: 0,1:38:30.04,1:38:32.76,Default,,0,0,0,,快去了
Dialogue: 0,1:38:32.76,1:38:36.88,Default,,0,0,0,,就这样全射给我
Dialogue: 0,1:38:37.86,1:38:41.02,Default,,0,0,0,,好深
Dialogue: 0,1:39:11.02,1:39:13.40,Default,,0,0,0,,糟了
Dialogue: 0,1:39:18.32,1:39:22.18,Default,,0,0,0,,糟了，小枫
Dialogue: 0,1:39:22.18,1:39:25.52,Default,,0,0,0,,快射了
Dialogue: 0,1:39:25.52,1:39:28.58,Default,,0,0,0,,可以射里面吗
Dialogue: 0,1:39:28.58,1:39:33.27,Default,,0,0,0,,不行，射外面
Dialogue: 0,1:40:56.96,1:41:01.04,Default,,0,0,0,,悠太，其实我啊
Dialogue: 0,1:41:01.44,1:41:03.26,Default,,0,0,0,,已经结婚了
Dialogue: 0,1:41:04.76,1:41:06.52,Default,,0,0,0,,你发现了吗
Dialogue: 0,1:41:08.02,1:41:11.72,Default,,0,0,0,,隐约有感觉
Dialogue: 0,1:41:11.72,1:41:13.92,Default,,0,0,0,,觉得你应该结婚了
Dialogue: 0,1:41:15.16,1:41:17.99,Default,,0,0,0,,所以，忘了我吧
Dialogue: 0,1:41:17.99,1:41:22.72,Default,,0,0,0,,在北海道也要好好的
Dialogue: 0,1:41:25.08,1:41:26.64,Default,,0,0,0,,到了那边
Dialogue: 0,1:41:26.64,1:41:29.08,Default,,0,0,0,,一定能遇到好的人
Dialogue: 0,1:41:29.74,1:41:35.96,Default,,0,0,0,,悠太的话，一定会找到很棒的女朋友
Dialogue: 0,1:41:35.96,1:41:39.12,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯，我…
Dialogue: 0,1:41:39.12,1:41:42.04,Default,,0,0,0,,在北海道也会好好努力
Dialogue: 0,1:41:43.24,1:41:46.04,Default,,0,0,0,,加油
Dialogue: 0,1:42:03.42,1:42:06.50,Default,,0,0,0,,时间到了
Dialogue: 0,1:42:13.42,1:42:14.74,Default,,0,0,0,,从那以后
Dialogue: 0,1:42:14.74,1:42:18.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我再也没见过悠太
Dialogue: 0,1:42:18.46,1:42:21.82,Default,,0,0,0,,每当寂寞难耐
Dialogue: 0,1:42:21.82,1:42:24.50,Default,,0,0,0,,就把自己埋进工作里
Dialogue: 0,1:42:25.36,1:42:28.36,Default,,0,0,0,,哎，小枫
Dialogue: 0,1:42:28.36,1:42:31.52,Default,,0,0,0,,这个月你又是头牌呢
Dialogue: 0,1:42:31.52,1:42:34.28,Default,,0,0,0,,状态真好
Dialogue: 0,1:42:34.28,1:42:38.16,Default,,0,0,0,,刚进店没多久就拿头牌
Dialogue: 0,1:42:38.16,1:42:40.24,Default,,0,0,0,,你怕是第一个吧
Dialogue: 0,1:42:42.36,1:42:44.50,Default,,0,0,0,,没有啦
Dialogue: 0,1:42:44.50,1:42:47.38,Default,,0,0,0,,都是前辈带得好
Dialogue: 0,1:42:47.38,1:42:50.10,Default,,0,0,0,,还谦虚上了
Dialogue: 0,1:42:50.10,1:42:51.92,Default,,0,0,0,,就是啊
Dialogue: 0,1:42:51.92,1:42:55.66,Default,,0,0,0,,搞得我们像白混的
Dialogue: 0,1:42:55.66,1:42:57.80,Default,,0,0,0,,小枫！网络指名，新客人
Dialogue: 0,1:42:57.80,1:42:58.57,Default,,0,0,0,,好！
Dialogue: 0,1:42:58.57,1:43:00.98,Default,,0,0,0,,准备一下马上过去
Dialogue: 0,1:43:09.12,1:43:12.06,Default,,0,0,0,,说是新客人
Dialogue: 0,1:43:12.06,1:43:13.78,Default,,0,0,0,,没想到是你啊，悠太
Dialogue: 0,1:43:15.60,1:43:19.72,Default,,0,0,0,,骗了你，对不起
Dialogue: 0,1:43:20.18,1:43:24.80,Default,,0,0,0,,怕正常约你会躲着不见我
Dialogue: 0,1:43:24.80,1:43:29.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我把工作辞了
Dialogue: 0,1:43:29.40,1:43:34.32,Default,,0,0,0,,因为不想跟小枫分开
Dialogue: 0,1:43:35.96,1:43:42.76,Default,,0,0,0,,笨蛋…你都在干什么啊
Dialogue: 0,1:43:42.76,1:43:45.98,Default,,0,0,0,,笨蛋也无所谓
Dialogue: 0,1:43:47.58,1:43:54.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我最喜欢小枫了，全世界最喜欢
Dialogue: 0,1:44:53.94,1:44:56.76,Default,,0,0,0,,你果然很美
Dialogue: 0,1:45:29.72,1:45:31.14,Default,,0,0,0,,没事吧
Dialogue: 0,1:45:48.32,1:45:50.96,Default,,0,0,0,,没事
Dialogue: 0,1:46:03.84,1:46:06.32,Default,,0,0,0,,哭成这样了
Dialogue: 0,1:46:29.52,1:46:32.58,Default,,0,0,0,,一直好想这样抱你
Dialogue: 0,1:49:57.10,1:49:58.49,Default,,0,0,0,,好厉害
Dialogue: 0,1:50:03.72,1:50:05.48,Default,,0,0,0,,能再见到你真好
Dialogue: 0,1:51:15.72,1:51:20.10,Default,,0,0,0,,看着我
Dialogue: 0,1:52:07.02,1:52:10.22,Default,,0,0,0,,不行
Dialogue: 0,1:52:45.32,1:52:48.12,Default,,0,0,0,,抱紧我
Dialogue: 0,1:58:12.70,1:58:15.82,Default,,0,0,0,,受不了了
Dialogue: 0,1:58:34.60,1:58:38.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我好喜欢你，小枫
Dialogue: 0,1:58:38.04,1:58:42.66,Default,,0,0,0,,别叫花名，叫我优香
Dialogue: 0,1:58:45.12,1:58:50.62,Default,,0,0,0,,优香…优香
Dialogue: 0,1:58:56.14,1:59:01.12,Default,,0,0,0,,优香，喜欢你
Dialogue: 0,1:59:06.00,1:59:11.98,Default,,0,0,0,,优香，最爱你了
Dialogue: 0,1:59:14.78,1:59:15.96,Default,,0,0,0,,没事吧
Dialogue: 0,1:59:15.96,1:59:17.64,Default,,0,0,0,,没事
Dialogue: 0,2:00:06.03,2:00:08.66,Default,,0,0,0,,优香…舒服
Dialogue: 0,2:00:09.94,2:00:12.51,Default,,0,0,0,,优香也很舒服哦
Dialogue: 0,2:00:22.64,2:00:25.51,Default,,0,0,0,,优香，看着我
Dialogue: 0,2:01:46.32,2:01:50.02,Default,,0,0,0,,狠狠顶到最深处
Dialogue: 0,2:01:55.72,2:02:03.66,Default,,0,0,0,,再深一点
Dialogue: 0,2:13:12.26,2:13:17.04,Default,,0,0,0,,没事吧，看哪呢
Dialogue: 0,2:13:17.52,2:13:21.98,Default,,0,0,0,,没事…要去了，去了
Dialogue: 0,2:13:29.68,2:13:35.18,Default,,0,0,0,,好多
Dialogue: 0,2:13:36.64,2:13:40.92,Default,,0,0,0,,明明刚去过
Dialogue: 0,2:13:59.86,2:14:01.94,Default,,0,0,0,,太舒服了
Dialogue: 0,2:15:33.20,2:15:36.16,Default,,0,0,0,,救命，受不了了
Dialogue: 0,2:18:34.72,2:18:41.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我想坐上来
Dialogue: 0,2:18:49.88,2:18:54.20,Default,,0,0,0,,下面受不了了，往上一点
Dialogue: 0,2:19:12.34,2:19:14.68,Default,,0,0,0,,不行
Dialogue: 0,2:19:27.44,2:19:29.02,Default,,0,0,0,,要去了
Dialogue: 0,2:20:00.67,2:20:08.38,Default,,0,0,0,,不行，去了
Dialogue: 0,2:21:34.92,2:21:36.12,Default,,0,0,0,,好厉害
Dialogue: 0,2:21:36.12,2:21:43.50,Default,,0,0,0,,快射了…射给我，全射里面
Dialogue: 0,2:21:43.50,2:21:54.70,Default,,0,0,0,,全射里面可以吗
Dialogue: 0,2:21:56.00,2:21:57.38,Default,,0,0,0,,真的可以？
Dialogue: 0,2:22:00.72,2:22:03.94,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起，要射了
Dialogue: 0,2:22:57.36,2:23:00.67,Default,,0,0,0,,不行了
Dialogue: 0,2:23:00.67,2:23:05.34,Default,,0,0,0,,就这样，身心都完全契合的我们
Dialogue: 0,2:23:05.34,2:23:10.20,Default,,0,0,0,,彻底越过了那条线
Dialogue: 0,2:23:10.20,2:23:12.26,Default,,0,0,0,,原本只是
Dialogue: 0,2:23:13.32,2:23:17.38,Default,,0,0,0,,为了排遣寂寞才开始的工作
Dialogue: 0,2:23:17.92,2:23:22.96,Default,,0,0,0,,没想到在这里，遇到了命定之人



